{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.AppendixSurreals.VacuumEpsilon","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.VacuumEpsilon","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.VacuumEpsilon.residual_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.VacuumEpsilon.residual_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/VacuumEpsilon.lean#L44-L44","doc":"The residual vanishes (the conjecture is the assertion that\nthis holds). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.VacuumEpsilon.residual","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.VacuumEpsilon.residual","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/VacuumEpsilon.lean#L41-L41","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\n      The Hoefsmit scattering pipeline assigns to each link $L$ a\n*geometric energy* $\\mathrm{Geom}(L) \\in \\mathbb{R}$\n([Hoefsmit scattering pipeline](#prop:hoefsmit-scattering-pipeline)).\nThe vacuum normalisation requires $\\mathrm{Geom}(\\bigcirc) = 0$\non the unknot, so that the empty link contributes nothing to\nparticle masses.\n\n      Field schema below is a structural placeholder; refine per §3b\n      to match the conjecture's actual content. The placeholder is\n      trivially inhabited; the conjectural content is carried by the\n      narrative block, not by this field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.VacuumEpsilon.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.VacuumEpsilon.mk","kind":"ctor","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/VacuumEpsilon.lean#L26-L26","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.VacuumEpsilon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.VacuumEpsilon","kind":"class","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/VacuumEpsilon.lean#L23-L44","doc":"Infinitesimal vacuum: $\\\\mathrm{Geom}(\\\\bigcirc) = \\\\varepsilon$\n\nConjectural class — see [`conj:vacuum-epsilon`](../../../quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/vacuum-epsilon.md). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:vacuum-epsilon","label":"conj:vacuum-epsilon","md":"quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/vacuum-epsilon.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}